[{"answer":"Hello, Oyster Bay Sailing Club. How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hi. I'd like to find out about sailing courses for beginners.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem. Is it for yourself?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I had a look online but I'm not sure which course would be best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well you might be interested in our Taster Days?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Possibly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So these are for people who've never sailed before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"it's basically an introduction to sailing to find out whether you enjoy it and want to carry on with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much is that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It's £120 for the day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's reduced to £110 each if there are two of you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it would just be me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh that's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd be in a small group, usually about eight people but no more than ten","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and everyone's always very friendly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh huh. And are there any other suitable courses?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"The other option is the Level 1 course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"These are two-day weekend courses and we run those all year round.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And what do you learn on that course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a mix of theory and practical skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So you learn about things like the weather, which is obviously really important","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and also the tides, as well as learning basic sailing skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"You go out into the harbour in special training dinghies for beginners,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"two people in each dinghy and an instructor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"He or she will make sure you understand everything you need to know about safety.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds like hard work!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but you'll have a lot of fun too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And the cost of that one is...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/28.mp3"},{"answer":"£200.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/29.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's a bit cheaper if you decide to join the club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/30.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a discount for members.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm not sure about that yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/32.mp3"},{"answer":"You've got plenty of time to decide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And does the cost include everything?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, everything's included","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and you also get a really good dictionary explaining all the sailing terminology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/36.mp3"},{"answer":"A lot of people struggle with this at first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It's got lots of pictures, so I'm sure you'd find it really helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And on completion of the course you get a certificate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you're ready to move on to the Level 2 course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's all the info you need for now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Just a couple of general things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/43.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, it's really important that you know how to swim.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm pretty confident in the water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/46.mp3"},{"answer":"The other thing I should tell you is that we provide wetsuits and life jackets","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but you need to bring swimming trunks and some old trainers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And a towel?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And you might want to bring your own toiletries, things like shampoo.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/51.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/52.mp3"},{"answer":"What about food and drink?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Do I need to bring that or is there a café at the club?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you can get sandwiches, cakes and snacks there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The food's pretty reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/56.mp3"},{"answer":"OK good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well I think I'm interested in the Level 1 course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/58.mp3"},{"answer":"But I know absolutely nothing about sailing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/59.mp3"},{"answer":"so is there anything I can do to prepare myself a bit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I recommend you watch some videos we use for training.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/61.mp3"},{"answer":"They're available online.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I can send you the link.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/63.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll give you an idea of what to expect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect, thanks. That would be very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh and just one other thing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be cycling to the club and will need somewhere to put valuables.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm just wondering if there are lockers for people to use?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there are plenty in the changing rooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Great...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-1-part-1-2026-07-12-16-15-19/70.mp3"}]
